{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16303161","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16303161","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1630316101:1":{"text":"ある種の器を使って、魂を操る魔法があるらしいんだ。","source_cn":"有一种魔法，可以通过某种容器操控人的灵魂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F8176BFEEFE2AFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1630316102:1":{"text":"つまり……この絵の中にも魂が入ってるかもしれないってこと？","source_cn":"你是说，这些画里可能会有灵魂？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x714D378C8E1E758C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1630316103:1":{"text":"かもしれないね。ところで、今日は天気もいいし……","source_cn":"这谁敢说呢？不过今天天气真好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9341F53B17D4F8E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1630316104:1":{"text":"よかったら、君の絵を描いてあげようか？","source_cn":"不如让我来为你画一幅画？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2562E2EC2694BDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1630316105:1":{"text":"……！まさかあなた……","source_cn":"……！你不会是要……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B31D1D9B2BDEE34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1630316106:1":{"text":"あはは、冗談だよ。そんな魔法なんてないから安心して。","source_cn":"哎呀，安心啦，不会有那种魔法的。我吓吓你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8489086B4482DF75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1630316107:1":{"text":"あなた……！ふんっ！","source_cn":"你……！哼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85B97BE492E4863D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1630316108:1":{"text":"ちょっと待って！エマ、ごめんって！","source_cn":"不要走啊！艾玛，我错了！艾玛——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F41EDB1F0E226AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:图格":{"text":"トゥーグ","source":"图格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:艾玛":{"text":"エマ","source":"艾玛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}